# Root build context is used by all 14 Go service images (context: .).
# Everything below is never needed inside an image build, so excluding it
# keeps the context small and stops unrelated changes from busting caches.

# VCS / CI / tooling
.git
.github
.claude
.gitignore

# Docs (large, not needed at build time)
*.md
**/*.md

# Secrets / local env (never bake into an image)
.env
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Node / frontend artifacts (frontend builds from ./frontend with its own context)
**/node_modules
frontend/.next
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/test-results
frontend/coverage

# Go build outputs / committed binaries
services/*/server
**/*.test
**/*.out

# Test & coverage reports
**/test-reports
**/coverage
**/coverage.html
**/coverage.out

# .NET build outputs (inventory/payment build from their own contexts, but
# keep these out of the root context too for safety)
**/bin
**/obj
